@startuml SQ09_View_Customer_List
title UC30 - View Customer List Sequence Diagram (Code-based Flow)
autonumber "1:"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ActorFontColor #000000
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    GroupBorderColor #000000
}

actor "Pharmacist" as Pharmacist #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nCustomerDirectoryPage.jsx" as DirectoryPage #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\ncustomerApi.js" as CustomerApi #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nCustomerController" as CustomerController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nCustomerServiceImpl" as CustomerServiceImpl #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nCustomerRepository" as CustomerRepository #7ACFF5
database "<<entity>>\nSQL Server (PMS DB)" as DB #7ACFF5

activate Pharmacist #7ACFF5
== Phase 1: Load Initial Customer Directory ==
Pharmacist -> DirectoryPage: Navigate to Customer Directory (/customers)
activate DirectoryPage #7ACFF5

DirectoryPage -> CustomerApi: getCustomers({ page: 0, size: 10, sortBy: 'createdAt', sortDir: 'desc' })
activate CustomerApi #7ACFF5

CustomerApi -> CustomerController: GET /api/v1/customers?page=0&size=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortDir=desc (Bearer AT)
activate CustomerController #7ACFF5

CustomerController -> CustomerServiceImpl: getCustomers(keyword=null, status=null, 0, 10, "createdAt", "desc")
activate CustomerServiceImpl #7ACFF5

CustomerServiceImpl -> CustomerRepository: findAll(Specification<Customer>, Pageable)
activate CustomerRepository #7ACFF5
CustomerRepository -> DB: SELECT * FROM customers ORDER BY created_at DESC OFFSET 0 ROWS FETCH NEXT 10 ROWS
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> CustomerRepository: Page<Customer> + totalElements
deactivate DB
CustomerRepository --> CustomerServiceImpl: Page<Customer>
deactivate CustomerRepository

CustomerServiceImpl --> CustomerController: PageResponse<CustomerResponse> (content, totalElements, totalPages, pageNo)
deactivate CustomerServiceImpl

CustomerController --> CustomerApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success(response)
deactivate CustomerController

CustomerApi --> DirectoryPage: PageResponse<CustomerResponse>
deactivate CustomerApi

DirectoryPage --> Pharmacist: Render customer table with pagination controls

== Phase 2: Search by Phone / Name ==
Pharmacist -> DirectoryPage: Type phone number "0987123456" into search input
DirectoryPage -> DirectoryPage: Debounce 300ms

DirectoryPage -> CustomerApi: getCustomers({ keyword: '0987123456', page: 0, size: 10 })
activate CustomerApi #7ACFF5

CustomerApi -> CustomerController: GET /api/v1/customers?keyword=0987123456&page=0&size=10
activate CustomerController #7ACFF5

CustomerController -> CustomerServiceImpl: getCustomers("0987123456", null, 0, 10, "createdAt", "desc")
activate CustomerServiceImpl #7ACFF5

CustomerServiceImpl -> CustomerRepository: findAll(Specification<Customer> with phone/name LIKE, Pageable)
activate CustomerRepository #7ACFF5
CustomerRepository -> DB: SELECT * FROM customers WHERE phone LIKE '%0987123456%' OR LOWER(full_name) LIKE '%0987123456%'
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> CustomerRepository: Filtered Page<Customer>
deactivate DB
CustomerRepository --> CustomerServiceImpl: Page<Customer>
deactivate CustomerRepository

CustomerServiceImpl --> CustomerController: PageResponse<CustomerResponse>
deactivate CustomerServiceImpl

CustomerController --> CustomerApi: HTTP 200 OK + Filtered PageResponse
deactivate CustomerController

CustomerApi --> DirectoryPage: Filtered PageResponse
deactivate CustomerApi

DirectoryPage --> Pharmacist: Update customer table with matching search results
deactivate DirectoryPage
deactivate Pharmacist
@enduml